WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.106
Wuro e ko'e maako. Ɗuum woni kaalanuuji Bwaba'en.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.704
Nder jemma yeeso duniyaaru, Wuro wurtini koode go'oto go'o.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.474
O wurtini duniyaaru, o wurtiniri maayo. O waɗani leɗɗe ɓesdaaki nder maago maako.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.738
Haa saa'i maajum, asama ɗon hawta nder cuuɗi. Wuro ɗon yaha caka worɓe.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.234
Tiko, ɓiɗɗo gorko nder gariiri ndin, ɗon wurta e koyɗe maako. Wuro ummi mo haa asama.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.352
Sey o hokki Bado, maccuɗo njamndi.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:04.782
Fuuɗee ko'e mon nder sahaa ndiyam. Duniyaaru hokkata'on ceede.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:20.472
Ngam maajum Hamama waɗi ko o wi'i nder suudu maako.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:34.290
Wuro wari, o nani, o jooɗi to maako. Sey o maɓɓiti, o nyaami, ammaa juŋŋgo maako duumi dow leɗɗe.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.848
Hame ɗon ɓeyda ɓeydagol, ɓeydigol.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.508
Sey maɓɓere nde'e udditii jungo Wuro.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:55.290
Wuro wurtini jungo maako ɗon maaki. Ɗuum waɗi jayngol maayi.

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:00.446
Miɗo yaafaa, Wuro! Mi yi'ii on!

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:08.496
Yimɓe gariiri'en ngari bee hakkiilo, ɓaawo maajum ɓe njogii ngam kulol.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:18.826
Wuro yi'i Hame, ammaa o ɓeydi masin. O hocci hoore maako, o ummi bee hakkiilo.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:25.346
Sey Allah wurtini mo haa asama. Gaɗa ɗon, o laati dow koode.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:39.690
To Wuro walaa, duniyaaru ɗon ɓeyda. Nde ndiyam ɓeydi waraa, leɗɗe boo mbaɗti.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:47.960
Nder jemma, gooduɗo geɗal ƴiwoyi nder suudu.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:56.968
ndiyam ɗam ngam saare am!

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:01.372
Nden kamɓe boo, ngam ɓe maayi bee weelo?

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:06.968
Ɓiɗɗo Tiko warti nyawɗo.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:16.780
Wuro, nana en!

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.424
Walaa jaabɗo.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:33.204
Ammaa Wuro ɗon yi'a diga dow. O udditiri juuɗe maako, sey yiite tati ndilli dow duniyaaru. Ɓiɓɓe maako tato.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:50.018
Kwere, yiite maɓɓiti lesdi bee kuuje maako. Ɗuum ɓooyii e duule.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:01.136
Wakkati maajum ndiyam dilli, ɓooyaari boo ummi.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:16.648
Eeli ɗon ɗaɓɓita wayloore nder leɗɗe, sey hayre wari.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:29.160
Soxo, ruuhu nder le'i wurtini nyaamo maako, o ɗaɓɓiti ndu.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:37.602
O hoo'i leɗɗe ɗe nyaameteeɗe. Nden Tiko ummii.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:53.880
Toonde, Dwo wari, ɓeynguɗo leɗɗe.

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:04.930
O wurtini, o dilli, o jippinii lekki maako yeeso Bado e Sanou. Yimɓe ɗiɗo fuu ɓe kawti juuɗe maɓɓe.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:14.400
Yimɓe nder gariiri ndin fuu mbi'i:

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:34.626
Nde jemma waɗi, Hamé ɓeydi moƴƴugo. O ɗon ɗaɓɓita gite maako haa asama.

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:38.728
Gooto ɗon jaabana mo.
